            "elite": 25,
            "moderate": 50,
            "amateur": 90
          },
          "queue_risk_min": 20,
          "bail_rate": 0.10,
          "notes": "Tower crux can be rappelled on descent (slings in place). Simul-climb the easy sections to save time."
